OL,3,AEarly release scheme could see
OL,4,Adangerous criminals released,
OL,5,AConservatives warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FDangerous criminals could be freed
OL,8,Funder the government's early release
OL,9,Fscheme for England and Wales, the
OL,10,FConservatives have warned.
OL,12,FShadow justice secretary Nick Timothy
OL,13,Ftold the BBC that to prevent one group
OL,14,Fof dangerous criminals being released
OL,15,Fearly, Andy Burnham was "looking at
OL,16,Freleasing a different group of
OL,17,Fdangerous prisoners".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
