OL,3,AParents of seriously ill children
OL,4,Ashould get paid leave, says
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FParents of children with serious
OL,8,Fillnesses or disabilities should be
OL,9,Fentitled to paid leave from work, the
OL,10,Fchildren's commissioner Dame Rachel de
OL,11,FSouza has said.
OL,13,FShe called on the government to
OL,14,Fintroduce a legal right to 12 weeks of
OL,15,Fpaid leave at 90% of normal pay in
OL,16,Forder to lift the "immense pressure"
OL,17,Fand lost earnings families face when a
OL,18,Fchild develops a debilitating
OL,19,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
