OL,3,AEight killed and 18 missing after ferry
OL,4,Acapsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ship's captain and seven crew
OL,7,Fmembers have been detained as part of
OL,8,Fan investigation into "how this tragedy
OL,9,Foccurred", Ustel wrote on social media.
OL,11,FOfficials say the vast majority of
OL,12,Fthose on board have been rescued. A
OL,13,Fsearch and rescue operation with
OL,14,FTurkish authorities is under way.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
